ived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-13T22:57:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T12:36:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\narch linux\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen loading minimum reproduction project, tool script is registered as tool, as expected:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0171abb7-b9f4-4bbe-9a23-98c5e83b8fcc)\n\nWhen you launch an external editor and edit the project (in my case Vscodium with [godot tools](https://open-vsx.org/extension/geequlim/godot-tools) plugin), and reload current project, the script is no longer marked as tool and won't run in editor:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64977515-8e51-47ac-be2c-495850a15499)\n\nThis appears to be because of a class declared within a tool script:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\nvar settings = Settings.new()\n\nclass Settings:\n    extends Resource\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. load project\n2. open code editor with godot tools plugin\n3. reload godot project from godot\n-  tool script no longer marked as tool\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[tool_script_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19237878/tool_script_bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1"